+# NOTICE: attribution and modification notice
+
+## Original work
+
+NexVora LLM Studio is a modified version of **AnythingLLM Mobile**
+(<https://github.com/Mintplex-Labs/anythingllm-mobile>), Copyright © Mintplex Labs, Inc. and contributors,
+licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0 or later. The original `LICENSE` file is included unchanged.
+
+## Modifications by NexVora Lab's Ofc (GPL v3 section 5(a) notice)
+
+These files were changed or added; the dates of modification are 2026.
+
+- Branding: app name, `app.json` display name, Android `strings.xml`, launcher icons, `src/assets/logo/nexvora-mark.png`, PDF/DOCX/PPTX export wordmarks, user-visible strings in `src/locales/*/common.json`, onboarding logos, notification channel name, assistant system prompt.
+- Theme: `global.css`, `src/utils/theme.ts` and colour literals across `src/**` (cyan-violet palette).
+- New: `src/utils/brand.ts`, `src/screens/UserSettings/About/index.tsx` (Developer, Company, Technical Information, Credits & Legal), `brand/make_icons.py`.
+- Privacy: Firebase Analytics and Crashlytics removed (`android/build.gradle`, `android/app/build.gradle`, `package.json`, `yarn.lock`, `google-services.json`, `firebase.json`, manifest AD_ID permission, `android/fastlane/Fastfile`). `src/utils/Telemetry/index.ts` is now a no-op with the same API.
+- Identity: `applicationId` changed to `com.nexvora.llmstudio` (the Kotlin `namespace`/package `com.anythingllm` is intentionally unchanged so native modules keep working); version set to 1.0.0.
+- Links to the original project's update server, Play Store listing, issue tracker, Discord, docs and highlight-video CDN were disabled or removed.
+- New: `src/utils/endpoints.ts`, `SOURCE.md`; onboarding artwork `src/assets/onboarding/*` regenerated by `brand/make_icons.py`; Home screen and drawer header redesigned.
+- UI redesign: `src/components/ModelCard/index.tsx`, `src/screens/UserSettings/AdvancedModelPreferences/providers/nativeOptions/index.tsx`, chat message/TopBar/EmptyList/PromptInput styling, drawer items, onboarding preset card.
+- Font: the licensed Clash Display dependency was removed; the app uses Inter.
+- CI: `.github/workflows/android-debug.yml` added; the upstream CLA workflow was removed.
+
+## Third-party components
+
+The app depends on many open-source packages (React Native, llama.rn / llama.cpp, WatermelonDB, NativeWind,
+react-native-paper, and others), each under its own license. A complete generated license inventory has **not** yet been produced.
+Generate one before public distribution (for example with `npx license-checker --production`) and ship it with the app.
+
+## Brand
+
+"NexVora", the NexVora logo and icon are NexVora Lab's Ofc branding. "AnythingLLM" and "Mintplex Labs" belong to their
+owners and are used here only to identify the original work.
